{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124216","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124216/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124216/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124216/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124216","id":5726635334,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVVWFRg","number":124216,"title":"100% CPU in Project Manager on web platform","user":{"login":"wjt","id":86760,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86760?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt","html_url":"https://github.com/wjt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-10-06T10:09:45Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T08:52:59Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in:\n\n- v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]\n- v4.5.2.stable.official [6ce3de25a]\n- v4.6.3.stable.official [7d41c59c4]\n- v4.7.2.stable.official [ed1daf0bf]\n- v4.8.dev7.official [c971f93e7]\n\nNot reproducible in:\n\n- v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8]\n- (…did not bother with intermediate versions while bisecting…)\n- 4.0.stable\n\nso I conclude this was a regression in 4.4.x.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.2.stable - Web - Single-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL ES 3 (Compatibility) - WebKit WebGL -  (2 threads) - AudioWorklet (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe web build of the Project Manager consumes 100% of one CPU, continuously. I have reproduced this in Chromium on desktop Linux (Bluefin specifically, i.e. Fedora) on a higher-end laptop, and in Chrome on a lower-end Chromebook. CPU usage is measured both by Chrom(e|ium)'s built-in task manager and with `htop` on desktop (`top` in `crosh` on chromeOS).\n\n<img width=\"1250\" height=\"940\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eda040d1-f140-46da-81f1-acc45aea1253\" />\n\n<img width=\"1237\" height=\"551\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e38ae143-dada-400b-ad87-919bcb1aa7f1\" />\n\nThis is not a general problem with the web build of the editor because once I open a project, provided I do not have a scene open, the idle CPU usage is more reasonable.\n\n<img width=\"1250\" height=\"918\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b8e3643d-d21b-4dc4-b1ae-b480e7256bce\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Browse to https://editor.godotengine.org/releases/latest/ (adjust version to taste)\n- Click **Start Godot Editor**\n- Once Project Manager is open, observe its CPU use\n- Edit a simple project; ensure no scenes are open; observe the low CPU use of the editor itself.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nn/a: this is a Project Manager issue.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124216/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124216/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}